rhp-csrc
========

This crate's own files (src/, shim/, glue/, build.rs, tools/) are licensed
under MIT OR Apache-2.0, like the rest of rhp. shim/ re-declares the subset of
php-src's Zend/ and main/ header API that the vendored C uses; those
declarations follow php-src's (Zend Engine License 2.00 / PHP License 3.01).
shim/php_printf.c ports main/snprintf.c's and main/spprintf.c's format
converter (PHP License 3.01, parts under the Apache Group's 1995-1998
licence; THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES section 32).
The vendored files under vendor/ keep their own licence headers and are
listed below. Everything here is compiled into static archives; rhp ships its
source. The repository's THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES carries the same entries with the
full notices.


